{
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "……塔顶……建筑师……",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "对手确认。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "……让他……倒下……",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "……又……倒下了……",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "下一回合。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "……下一……回合……",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "……拳手……还……站得起来……？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "（缓缓举起双拳。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NEOW.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "……很好……上去吧……",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "哎哟，这拳头！别把我的东西都碰碎了！你想拿哪件，我帮你找！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（把张开的手掌慢慢收回。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "对，对，轻拿轻放。你看，你也学得挺快嘛！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你胸口那个坑，我这儿正好有块差不多大小的东西能塞进去……",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "保留。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "行吧！每个人都有舍不得扔的破烂！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "你上次拿走的东西还好用吧？等等，你不会把它也拿去打人了吧？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "（看了一眼自己的拳头。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_DARV.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "好吧，我大概知道答案了。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "把手放下来，让我看看……嗯，这身金属倒是有些值得装点的地方。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（稍稍放低拳头。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "对，就这样。你总不能一直挡着我的作品。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "这些划痕，真是可惜。你每次受伤，都要把我的心意也弄坏一点吗？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "还会回来。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "那就尽量完整地回来。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "看，他们都在看你。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "（转身，摆出防守架势。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "……有时候，你只需要接受赞美。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "你没有拿武器！忘在暗港了？？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（举起右拳，又举起左拳。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "哦！！带了两个！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "这个会发光！这个也会！你的拳头能发光吗？？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "（两拳轻轻相碰，迸出一点火星。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "会！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "暗港的拳头！走到这里来了？！谁把你带出来的？？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "步行。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_OROBAS.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "我看见腿了！我问的是……算了，看看这个！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "你手臂里的声音……一直没有停。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（放松了紧握的手指。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "这样就好。歇一会儿……下一场还没开始。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "我梦见你站在一块很小的地板上。四周……全是倒下的东西。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "已经离开。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "嗯……我看见了。你走得很远。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "钢铁也会疲倦的……来，让我的一部分替你承受。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "（向那团温热的血肉伸出手。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_PAEL.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "慢慢来。你现在不用握拳。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "拳头够大！！来，打我！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（挡开迎面的一击，随即还了一拳。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "哈哈哈！！就该这样！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "我有这么多武器，你真就只要这双拳头！？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "已经装配。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "哈哈！！那就再给它们装点东西！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "你还在挡！？打过来！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "正在等待。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TANX.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "等什么——噢！！好拳！！",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "亲爱的，你的手都僵住了。到我这边来，暖一暖。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（伸出布满凹痕的双手。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "哎呀，这可真是双勤劳的小手。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "坐下吧。我这里有汤，还有一双暖和的手套。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "（看了看手套，又看了看自己的拳头。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "放心，亲爱的。我会把它们弄合身的。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "总把手举在脸前面，是怕我打你吗？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "（慢慢放下双拳。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_TEZCATARA.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "这就对了。让我好好看看那些需要处理的毛病。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "我能让你的下一拳永远不会落空。只要你愿意付出一点代价。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "（没有放下防守的手。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "真可惜。你看起来比那些会流血的家伙还谨慎。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "没有裁判，没有观众。你还要替谁赢下去？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "自己。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "哦……这倒是个很容易利用的理由。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "你知道吧？你还会倒下，还会回来。下一场，下一场，再下一场。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "准备就绪。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_VAKUU.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "那么，享受你的比赛吧。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "暗港的拳击构装体？你的活动范围不该到这里。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "对手确认。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "看来你的识别模块也需要拆下来检查。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你被造出来，就是为了重复那些动作。举手，出拳，回到原位。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "（站稳，举起双拳。）",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "……我说的是回到原位。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "又是你。那些损坏的零件到底是谁在替你更换？",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "下一回合。",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PUNCHCONSTRUCT_THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNCHCONSTRUCT-CONSTRUCT_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "那就把你拆得更彻底一点。"
}
